From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 20:50:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Baseline: inline decorations, layout and robustness fixes

- stylo_to_parley extracts padding-inline-*, border-inline-*-
  {width,color}, background-color and border-radius into the new parley
  TextStyle fields, so the existing (Inline, Flow) path in
  layout/construct.rs gains box decorations.
- Inline-IFC abs-pos padding-box containing block + zero-line post-pass
  (layout/inline.rs); first-baseline report for inline roots.
- Paint-order float gate in layout/damage.rs: a float only bumps the
  paint layer for position:static elements.
- <input> placeholder polyfill (is_showing_placeholder on TextInputData
  + construct-time synthesis); <select> label sync.
- pub visibility on util::parse_svg_image; currentColor root-stamp for
  inline <svg>.
- BaseDocument::clear_style_snapshots(): resolve_stylist clears element
  snapshots only after a successful traverse_dom, so a cascade panic
  costs one frame instead of livelocking the navigation generation
  (vuejs.org sticky transparent-background).
